{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/81e066bffcf4ea3ec95bb44766c29aba.poster.avif?t=1758641075\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/81e066bffcf4ea3ec95bb44766c29aba.webm?t=1758641075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/81e066bffcf4ea3ec95bb44766c29aba.mp4?t=1758641075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival is more fun with friends! Explore, build, and battle together in an immersive shared world, sharing the adventure every step of the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/a5e06323fe83d46952f4472cad1615f0.poster.avif?t=1758641075\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/a5e06323fe83d46952f4472cad1615f0.webm?t=1758641075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/a5e06323fe83d46952f4472cad1615f0.mp4?t=1758641075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your base is the heart of your survival. Gather resources to construct and upgrade your home, expanding its functionality and customizing it to suit your needs and milestones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/8693128431f7f2bef149185064fe4f5a.poster.avif?t=1758641075\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/8693128431f7f2bef149185064fe4f5a.webm?t=1758641075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/8693128431f7f2bef149185064fe4f5a.mp4?t=1758641075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your character by mastering essential professions like Mining, Herbalism, and Fishing. Level up your skills to unlock powerful recipes and tools, shaping your survival strategy and enhancing your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/da0522e3c0b475aa0f3bc544a2b22474.poster.avif?t=1758641075\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/da0522e3c0b475aa0f3bc544a2b22474.webm?t=1758641075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/da0522e3c0b475aa0f3bc544a2b22474.mp4?t=1758641075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Shamania is full of dangers. Face enemies and overcome challenges to secure valuable rewards and strengthen your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/70e02d27470847e066cdfdfb3bdde6c9.poster.avif?t=1758641075\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/70e02d27470847e066cdfdfb3bdde6c9.webm?t=1758641075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868100/extras/70e02d27470847e066cdfdfb3bdde6c9.mp4?t=1758641075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover an extensive crafting system that evolves as you progress. Unlock recipes to create gear, tools, and items that empower you to face greater challenges and achieve your goals.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ascendant Shaman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2868100/1d32ef38011176c32cbffcc74e84f1b58addc693.jpg"},{"name":"Hands of the Earth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2868100/920cbe0715edd6cac321779c70a5316859307212.jpg"},{"name":"Beyond Mortality","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2868100/471c1eb991315cabaacbf1f4415db642e975231d.jpg"},{"name":"Keeper of Balance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2868100/f767137e672aa0b9ef976763705e4391f83215d0.jpg"},{"name":"Awakening","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2868100/1cb846304faaed3687fb7d0edb994233fbd95ecc.jpg"},{"name":"You Died","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2868100/cbed825a10590ecc6136d10d1c5aa3414e07c72f.jpg"},{"name":"Forge\u2019s Spark","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2868100/daaf97e17f08f51d1cfe0f65e2e0f62362e709cd.jpg"},{"name":"Echo Conqueror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2868100/f1fec6ca09f160f09ee8ec59d4d76644e2341bf7.jpg"},{"name":"Hundred Slain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2868100/4e0eb09dc4485fe5d9b4c5b25cafa487c1890fa1.jpg"},{"name":"Hands of Stone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2868100/a2b5a981e5143a20fc2621d7